# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read about how we decide on the types of problems we think might benefit "
"from a quantum solution, and look at some recent examples of work from the "
"community."
msgstr ""
"Baca tentang cara kita memilih jenis masalah yang kami fikir mungkin "
"mendapat manfaat daripada penyelesaian kuantum, dan lihat beberapa contoh "
"terkini kerja daripada komuniti."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which problems are quantum computers good for?"
msgstr "Masalah apakah yang sesuai untuk komputer kuantum?"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QSVM */}\n"
